{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>The spring of Jacob.</b> All who went forth from the spring of Jacob. And likewise \"from the waters of Judah they went forth\" (Isaiah 48:1)." "<b>Upon the land.</b> Like הארץ. And likewise \"and they shall pray toward this place\" (1 Kings 8:35)." "<b>Also his heavens.</b> The heavens of the land, or of Israel. And the sense is: for the yield of the land—to produce grain and wine—the heavens too continually give their dew, and there is no need to irrigate."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:26:37.633007162Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}